[[Remove Invisible Walls (World): walk through invisible barriers; floors stay solid]]}},{'v5.10',{[[Emote folders: My Emotes view with Favourites, Dances, Sitting & Poses, Greetings, plus your own]],
[[Right-click an emote to put it in any folders; the star still adds to Favourites in one click]],[[Rename a folder by clicking its name; open/close it by clicking the header]],
[[Tidier Emotes tab: My Emotes / Library switch, page controls under the list]]}},{'v5.9.1',{[[Fixed: emotes didn't play with Keep Emote While Moving on (and stopped when walking with it off)]]}},{'v5.9',{
